  "description": {
   "en": "Most of the people on social media were focused on the hashtag \"#LovePro\" and a certain man and woman. [Sheep], popular for their relationship advice from a female perspective and useful information for men, and [HARUMA], an attractive influencer and successful young entrepreneur from a prestigious university, who inadvertently became revered by the world for sharing his incomprehensible actions and disappointments in love due to being too popular. But the truth is that Mei, aka Sheep, has absolutely no luck with her own love life. A spartan romantic comedy about two people who sincerely want to fall in love, betting their pride and dignity on making the other say \"I love you\"!"
  },
